      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:7:7:17:9",
      "text": [
        " إِنْ قُلْتَ لِلَّهِ عَلَيَّ فَكَفَّارَةُ يَمِينٍ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Ibn Abu Umeyr, from Hammad, from Al Halby, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said, ‘If you were to say, ‘For the Sake of Allah<sup>azwj</sup> it is upon me’, so its expiation is that of an oath’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "9. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from ibn abu ‘ Umayr from Hammad from al-Halabiy who has narrated the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘If you say, ‘It is from Allah upon me’ then its expiation is like that for an oath.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
